<HelpTab>
    <HelpSection Title="Asking for time off">
        <ol>
            <li>Open the <strong>Time off</strong> tab on My Shifts.</li>
            <li>Select <strong>Request time off</strong>.</li>
            <li>Choose the <strong>Type</strong>, the <strong>First day</strong> and <strong>Last day</strong>,
                and check the <strong>Hours</strong>.</li>
            <li>Add a note for your manager if you need to, and send it.</li>
        </ol>
        <FluentText>You get an email when your manager decides.</FluentText>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="What the statuses mean">
        <FluentStack Orientation="Orientation.Vertical" VerticalGap="8px">
            <FluentStack VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center" HorizontalGap="12px">
                <FluentBadge Content="Waiting for approval" Color="BadgeColor.Warning" Appearance="BadgeAppearance.Filled" />
                <FluentText>Your manager hasn't decided yet.</FluentText>
            </FluentStack>
            <FluentStack VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center" HorizontalGap="12px">
                <FluentBadge Content="Approved" Color="BadgeColor.Success" Appearance="BadgeAppearance.Filled" />
                <FluentText>You're off. It shows on the rota.</FluentText>
            </FluentStack>
            <FluentStack VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center" HorizontalGap="12px">
                <FluentBadge Content="Rejected" Color="BadgeColor.Danger" Appearance="BadgeAppearance.Filled" />
                <FluentText>Your manager turned it down. Their reason is shown if they gave one.</FluentText>
            </FluentStack>
            <FluentStack VerticalAlignment="VerticalAlignment.Center" HorizontalGap="12px">
                <FluentBadge Content="Cancelled" Color="BadgeColor.Subtle" Appearance="BadgeAppearance.Filled" />
                <FluentText>You cancelled it, so it no longer applies.</FluentText>
            </FluentStack>
        </FluentStack>
        <FluentText>
            To cancel a request, select <strong>Cancel request</strong> on it and confirm.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="Your allowance">
        <FluentText>
            <strong>Your allowance</strong> shows how much of each type of time off you have left this holiday
            year. A type can also be <strong>Unlimited</strong>. If it says no allowance has been set up for you
            yet, ask your manager.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
